OL,3,GNEWSAF1 rivals battle it out in charity
OL,4,Afootball games
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormula 1 adversaries Mercedes and
OL,7,FAston Martin have taken their rivalry
OL,8,Ffrom the racetrack to the football
OL,9,Fpitch.
OL,11,FThe charity matches were held at St
OL,12,FJames Park in Brackley,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, on Thursday night.
OL,15,FMercedes won the men's match 3-1, while
OL,16,FSilverstone-based Aston Martin's
OL,17,Fwomen's team won their game 2-1.
OL,19,F"It's a fantastic way to bring both
OL,20,Fteams together off-track, said Imogen
OL,21,FTait, the charity and community
OL,22,Foutreach lead at Mercedes F1.
